     ccaa _n_a_m_e kkeeyy _h_o_s_t ccrreeaattee
             Create a private key for _h_o_s_t if one does not already exist.

     ccaa _n_a_m_e kkeeyy _h_o_s_t iinnssttaallll [_p_a_t_h]
             Install the private and public keys for _h_o_s_t into the active con‐
             figuration or specified _p_a_t_h.

     ccaa _n_a_m_e kkeeyy _h_o_s_t ddeelleettee
